  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1223201,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1990 - Die 1993'er Edition (Commodore Amiga)\n\nStep back into a mysterious world with *1990 - Die 1993'er Edition*, an expanded re-release of the original *1990* for the Commodore Amiga. While retaining the core gameplay and user interface that made the original a cult classic, this edition boasts significant technical enhancements. Prepare to be immersed in a visually updated experience, as hand-drawn graphics have been replaced with digitized photographs, bringing a new level of realism to the game's environments and characters. \n\nThe soundtrack has also been dramatically improved, featuring in-game music that enhances the atmosphere and tension. Though the narrative remains unchanged, the enhanced visuals and audio create a more compelling and engaging journey.  Explore the game's intriguing storyline, solve puzzles, and uncover secrets within a unique and captivating setting. *1990 - Die 1993'er Edition* offers a fresh perspective on a beloved classic, perfect for both returning fans and newcomers alike."
    },
